<h1>Privacy Policy &mdash; tzer0mHA</h1>

<p>tzer0mHA is a personal, private integration connecting my own Google account to my own self-hosted Home Assistant instance. It is not a public application and is not available for use by anyone other than me.</p>

<h2>What it accesses</h2>
<p>Google Calendar and Google Tasks data via the Google Calendar API and Google Tasks API, using OAuth 2.0.</p>

<h2>How it's used</h2>
<p>Solely to display my own calendar events and tasks within my personal Home Assistant dashboard and a networked e-ink display in my home. Data is not shared with, sold to, or accessed by any third party.</p>

<h2>Storage</h2>
<p>Calendar and task data is cached locally within my own Home Assistant instance for display purposes only.</p>

